<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Formatting Practice</title>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>✨ Formatting Practice</h1>
  <p>HTML provides several tags that help make text more meaningful and visually distinct.</p>

  <h2>Bold and Strong Text</h2>
  <p>The <b>African elephant</b> is the largest land animal in the world.</p>
  <p><strong>Always read instructions carefully</strong> before starting a new task.</p>

  <h2>Italic and Emphasized Text</h2>
  <p>The scientific name of a sunflower is <i>Helianthus annuus</i>.</p>
  <p>It is <em>extremely important</em> to stay hydrated during hot weather.</p>

  <h2>Highlighted and Small Text</h2>
  <p><mark>Recycling helps reduce waste</mark> and protects the environment.</p>
  <p>The Pacific Ocean covers a vast area of Earth. <small>(largest ocean on the planet)</small></p>

  <h2>Deleted Text Example</h2>
  <p>The event will take place on <del>Friday</del> Saturday.</p>

  <h2>Superscript and Subscript</h2>
  <p>The formula for carbon dioxide is CO<sub>2</sub>.</p>
  <p>The mathematical expression is a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>.</p>

</body>
</html>
